imud-influxdb (1.4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New always-on fields: wave_height, wave_period, roll_period,
    roll_amplitude, pitch_period, pitch_amplitude (with wave_valid), and
    the compass-health metrics mag_anomaly / mag_residual.
  * Rebuilt against wire v14.

 -- Richard Simpson <richcreations@gmail.com>  Sat, 11 Jul 2026 11:35:35 -0700

imud-influxdb (1.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Link libimud for stream access and packet validation (drops the local
    copy of the socket code). Runtime dependency: libimud.

 -- Richard Simpson <richcreations@gmail.com>  Fri, 10 Jul 2026 12:00:00 -0700

imud-influxdb (1.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rebuild against imud packet v12 (228 bytes).
  * Export the full v12 diagnostic set: gyro-bias estimate (gbias_x/y/z), its
    variance (gbias_var_x/y/z), the accel-quiescence metric (quiescence), heave
    rate (heave_rate), and a heave_valid boolean. As the diagnostics sink, heave
    is still emitted from t=0 so the pre-settle transient stays visible.

 -- Richard Simpson <richcreations@gmail.com>  Fri, 10 Jul 2026 03:00:00 -0700

imud-influxdb (1.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: bridge imud's binary stream to InfluxDB line protocol over
    UDP or HTTP (pure C, no dependencies).

